menu "AI-PASSPORT Werewolf identity"

config WEREWOLF_FACTORY_NICKNAME
    string "One-time factory nickname seed"
    default ""
    help
        Optional nickname written to the Werewolf identity NVS record only when
        no valid record exists (or when the revision below is newer). Leave
        empty in normal shared firmware. Nicknames are printable ASCII, at most
        ten characters, with no leading or trailing spaces.

config WEREWOLF_FACTORY_PROFILE_REVISION
    int "Factory nickname seed revision"
    range 1 2147483647
    default 1
    help
        Increase this only when intentionally replacing an already provisioned
        nickname with a new non-empty factory seed.

endmenu
